{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05028","headline":"幸白鹿观应制 · 沈佺期","name":"幸白鹿观应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫凤真人府，斑龙太上家。\n天流芝盖下，山转桂旗斜。\n圣藻垂寒露，仙杯落晚霞。\n唯应问王母，桃作几时花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈佺期","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05028.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05028","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}